# Client window map

[`client/WINDOW.md`](../../client/WINDOW.md) is the map of the pairing screen and the shell. When the desktop UI changes, update that file in the same turn: screens, sidebar, thread blocks, Settings, computer pane, and what is not in the window.

Do not add a control to the map until it is visible in `client/web` or `client/artek_buddy.py`.
